Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:16.80,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The rules keep changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:25.64,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:36.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:44.72,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I am resolved to sever this flood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:51.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:55.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}from loneliness and distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:01:00.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}One more step and you'll fall into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:05.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Don't fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,150)}I look towards the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:11.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}Chase !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:14.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Refined to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:20.36,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Never retreat, no matter the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:23.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I dare to defy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:27.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Always overcome the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:29.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ignite the seas with blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:34.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}bloom through trials and tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:38.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Even the sharpest thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:43.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}will be reduced into ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:47.56,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}What is there to fear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:56.72,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.72,0:02:15.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The suction force here is incomparably stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.48,0:02:17.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Resisting it with brute force
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:19.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,is definitely not the way to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.32,0:02:21.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,To break out of this situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.16,0:02:24.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must make this force my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:47.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(1747,484)}11 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:01.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Dao of the Underworld has 2 parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:04.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first one is the Underworld River.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.76,0:03:06.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second one is condensing the river's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.40,0:03:11.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been sitting here for 11 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:12.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,trapped by this suction force.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.80,0:03:14.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the power of this abyss
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.72,0:03:16.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,is an opportunity...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.84,0:03:18.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,to breakthrough !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:42.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,The principles of the heavens and the earth
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:44.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,lie within the flow of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:10.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am the power
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:13.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,of the Underworld !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.76,0:04:15.44,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1624,534)}Power of the Underworld\NDao of the Underworld 3rd part
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.76,0:04:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go down...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:26.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I beg you !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:28.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take me down !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.44,0:04:31.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I beg you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:33.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just want
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:36.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,to take a look...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:40.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,The All-Seer and company are about to arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.28,0:04:42.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:44.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:45.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:46.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,then go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:47.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.96,0:04:50.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to know the true history
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:51.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,of the bead in your soul ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:54.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.76,0:04:59.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,want that woman's broken soul to revive ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.28,0:05:01.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,What did you say !?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:04.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can tell you the origin of that bead
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:07.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the method to resurrect the broken soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:08.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can even
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:11.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,give you the opportunity to leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:13.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't know if what she said is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.76,0:05:14.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:15.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,a glimmer of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:17.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.24,0:05:21.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rest assured,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.08,0:05:23.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am not deceiving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:25.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm also making a big decision
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.76,0:05:28.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,by telling you all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:30.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:35.84,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1764,478)}Allheaven\NStar System
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.76,0:05:34.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,My homeland,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.40,0:05:38.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Allheaven Star System.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:43.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that we're here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.72,0:05:44.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:45.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Home...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:48.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,A long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:52.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,there was a sacred cultivation ground beneath the starry sky
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.68,0:05:54.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,called the Celestial Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.72,0:05:56.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Legend says it abandoned the cultivators
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:58.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,leaving behind only 4 gates of ascension.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:00.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.36,0:06:00.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rain,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.12,0:06:01.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thunder,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:02.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.28,0:06:06.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 4 gates later transformed into the Celestial Realms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:08.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 4 Celestial Realms govern the 4 Star Systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.96,0:06:11.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Above our Allheaven Star System
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.52,0:06:13.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,lies the Thunder Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:16.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Heaven Defying Bead
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:19.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,first appeared in our Allheaven Star System.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.48,0:06:21.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,When it appeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.56,0:06:26.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,all the top cultivators sensed the aura of the Ancient Celestial Domain
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.80,0:06:28.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and went crazy for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:30.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,But in the end, it vanished mysteriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:34.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Countless years later,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:36.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,for some unknown reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:40.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,it appeared in the Rain Celestial Realm of the Alliance Star System.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.16,0:06:44.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Was that ancient teleportation formation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:45.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,set up by you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:48.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:51.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it was indeed made by an Allheaven cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:54.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,That teleportation formation is defective,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:55.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,only an Allheaven Stone can activate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.20,0:06:58.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,That was the story of the Heaven Defying Bead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.76,0:07:00.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,As for that broken soul, my ancestors can revive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:03.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,You just need to take me through this vortex
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:05.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,to send me back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.52,0:07:07.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every word this woman says
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.52,0:07:10.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,is trying to lure me into the Allheaven Star System.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:14.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which sect in the Allheaven Star System do you belong to ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:16.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Allheaven Star System has no sects,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:19.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,only cultivation families.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:20.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I belong to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.32,0:07:23.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Xiang family on planet Dong Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.04,0:07:24.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.36,0:07:26.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't pass this vortex
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:28.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,with my current cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:30.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have the Heaven Defying Bead
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.20,0:07:31.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you will definitely pass !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.16,0:07:32.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Really ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.68,0:07:34.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,She's too confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:37.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,This woman must be hiding something !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:39.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to revive her !?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.24,0:07:40.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.64,0:07:42.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,She is luring me to Allheaven
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:43.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,so there must be a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.68,0:07:44.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,She knows too many of my secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.56,0:07:46.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This threat
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:47.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,cannot be left alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:48.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop this !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:49.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:50.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Without me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:53.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,the soul inside your bead will never be able to resurrect !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:54.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.80,0:07:56.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,going to give it up like this !?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.92,0:07:56.31,Second,,0,0,0,,Shut up !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:57.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:07:59.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:00.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are you doing !?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.40,0:08:02.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,This woman was sealed inside the scroll
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:03.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,with no hope of ever escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.24,0:08:07.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, she absorbed a Tattoo Beast Atlas and started recovering.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:08.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.42,0:08:08.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seal !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.88,0:08:10.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I curse your Dao to be completely eradicated
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.00,0:08:12.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and your soul to be extinguished !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:15.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Allheaven Star System is probably real.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:18.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the opportunity to revive Wan'er
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.56,0:08:19.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,might be slim
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:21.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,but must still be investigated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:23.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Xiang family of planet Dong Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:25.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The All-Seer is coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:28.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Demon Spirit Land is too dangerous now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:30.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since I have the token,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:31.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,they can't open the true cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.96,0:08:34.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I come back later,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:36.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must explore the true cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.20,0:08:38.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before leaving,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.92,0:08:41.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to settle a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:15.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sorry for keeping you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:18.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Quite a few losses...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.36,0:09:20.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,What happened to the beast pack ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:40.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing you're clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.96,0:09:41.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems that woman
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.36,0:09:43.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,has a connection with Senior Zhou Yi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:46.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior should be safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.76,0:09:49.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since I'm not restricted by the suction force,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.16,0:09:51.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't have to leave through the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:54.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,We'll go through the Water Demon Country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.20,0:10:11.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are they trying
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.56,0:10:13.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,to keep us here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:25.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.68,0:10:26.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,or stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:53.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Note: In the world of the Mosquito Beasts, if they were abandoned by their king, then they could only die, unless a new king appears that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.00,0:10:54.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Foolish children...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.08,0:10:57.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Given the purity of its bloodline,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:11:00.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,this beast could've only been tamed as a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.24,0:11:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, it wouldn't have ever followed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.32,0:11:05.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's all fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.28,0:11:11.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I return,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:13.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will break the restrictions here one by one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.68,0:11:16.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,and explore all the secrets of this true cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.20,0:11:26.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Until then,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:29.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,no one shall enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:41.88,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1648,471)\fad(300,000)}Stone Manor\NSky Demon City
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:48.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I will report to the Demon Emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:49.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,and recommend you as a Demon General.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.76,0:11:51.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,You'll be able to enter the Dragon Pool to cultivate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.16,0:11:54.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although you won't obtain the true inheritance,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,it should
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.56,0:11:56.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,benefit you a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:11:59.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.12,0:12:01.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will have to call you as Vice Commander-in-Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:05.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,This position of Vice Commander-in-Chief
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:06.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,is rightfully mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:08.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,If not for that despicable Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:10.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,what would Mo Lihai be ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.28,0:12:12.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin is my Junior Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.56,0:12:17.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person has been missing for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.44,0:12:18.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,he's probably dead by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:21.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,You remember him as your Junior Brother
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.96,0:12:24.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,but he probably doesn't remember his Senior Brother anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:26.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if he isn't dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.44,0:12:28.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will definitely kill him !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:29.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is that so ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.32,0:12:31.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop this farce,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:32.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,come out !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.88,0:12:44.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.88,0:12:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bold of you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.76,0:12:47.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,to storm my residence !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:52.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I once promised someone I would take your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:53.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:56.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the day I fulfill that promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:12:58.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Arrogant brat !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:10.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,An Illusory Yin puppet !?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:18.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Be careful of Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:28.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry, hurry !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.16,0:13:29.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.56,0:13:30.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop running !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.52,0:13:31.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Soul Refining Tribe
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.60,0:13:33.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be in your hands from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.64,0:13:36.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.52,0:13:37.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you leaving ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.28,0:13:44.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cultivation methods inside are for the tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.48,0:13:46.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thirteen,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:48.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,in your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.48,0:13:50.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the complete Giant Demon Clan's body cultivation method.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:52.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cultivate it diligently.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.56,0:13:55.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.96,0:13:56.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thirteen
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:13:58.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,will fulfill this mission !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.16,0:14:02.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving on this journey
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:04.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I don't know when I'll return.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:06.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.24,0:14:15.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Farewell,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:16.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.44,0:14:19.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Given Master's words,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.36,0:14:21.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.84,0:14:23.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will never meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.56,0:14:29.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Time to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:37.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:38.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,come out to greet me !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:05.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivators,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:06.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,after all these years
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:08.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're still as charming as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.92,0:15:11.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.24,0:15:13.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I sense that Greed is with you !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.92,0:15:15.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hand him over to me immediately !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:18.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.68,0:15:19.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,after all these years,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:22.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Sword Saint's temper has only grown worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:25.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Sword Saint's concern for his disciples
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.76,0:15:26.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,is only natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.92,0:15:32.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.92,0:15:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was Greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.24,0:15:35.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,He caused the deaths
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.20,0:15:36.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,of all my Junior Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.08,0:15:41.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little child,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.12,0:15:44.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,did this old man personally kill anyone ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.80,0:15:46.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although you didn't personally harm them,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:47.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,you still trapped us all
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.96,0:15:49.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,inside the purple mist as sacrifices !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:53.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,This old man trapped you inside
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.28,0:15:56.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,for the cave's token !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.68,0:15:59.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Instead of looking for the one who killed your Junior Brothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.44,0:16:01.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,you came looking for me instead ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.08,0:16:01.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Absurd !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:02.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,You !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:03.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enough !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.76,0:16:07.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where is
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:09.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,the token !?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.40,0:16:11.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,You might not believe what I'm about to say
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.56,0:16:15.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,but this old man swears by his tens of thousands of years of cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:16.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The token
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.24,0:16:17.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,is not in my hands !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.24,0:16:24.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's Wang Lin of the Heavenly Fate Sect !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:25.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,He took the token !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Trying to escape ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:45.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,They came earlier than expected !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xixue's aura !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.16,0:16:58.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it was you !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.24,0:17:01.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:02.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:07.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since the Blood Ancestor found out about Yao Xixue,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:09.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,he definitely won't let me off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.96,0:17:11.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I want to prevent him from pursuing me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.36,0:17:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have to muddy the waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.20,0:17:18.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cave you've been looking for
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:20.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,is not the third
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:22.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,but the fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.08,0:17:23.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:25.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,where is my daughter !?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.36,0:17:56.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,The fourth cave
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:17:58.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,does indeed exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:01.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,But he has clearly already occupied it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.24,0:18:02.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,If we don't capture him,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.88,0:18:04.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,then we will never
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.40,0:18:06.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,be able to enter the true cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.04,0:18:09.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Wang Lin must have had some fortuitous encounter
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.56,0:18:11.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,to be able to withstand the power of the vortex !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:14.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,My wife and I once tried to enter it back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.20,0:18:16.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although we failed before,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.84,0:18:18.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,if we join forces now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.76,0:18:21.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,we might be able to send someone across the vortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.20,0:18:28.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who goes ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:31.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which one of us can enter
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.56,0:18:33.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,that we can all trust ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:37.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unless it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:44.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person's cultivation is suitable
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:45.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,and enough to deal with Wang Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:49.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each of us will put a restriction on him
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.64,0:18:51.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,to make sure he doesn't escape our grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:53.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you all think ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.60,0:18:56.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think this will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:07.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I doubt he’d dare to act rashly.
