Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.31,0:20:20.95,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}and ask this question to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.39,0:20:26.83,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.77,0:20:26.83,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.99,0:20:33.91,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.55,0:20:33.91,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.31,0:20:39.67,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.83,0:20:39.67,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.67,0:20:47.19,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.99,0:20:47.19,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.15,0:20:51.59,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.59,0:20:51.59,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.71,0:20:55.43,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.03,0:20:55.43,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.51,0:21:01.15,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.11,0:21:01.15,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}What is the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.47,0:21:04.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Defying the flow of heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:04.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the heart I cultivate stays true.
